## 🔐 Security Requirements

| Requirement | Implementation |
|-------------|----------------|
| Auth | JWT với refresh token |
| Password | bcrypt với cost factor ≥ 12 |
| Rate Limit | 100 req/min cho auth, 1000 req/min cho API |
| CORS | whitelist domains trong env |
| HTTPS | enforce trong production |
| SQL Injection | Prisma parameterized queries |
| XSS | sanitize input, set CSP headers |
| CSRF | SameSite cookies + CSRF tokens |

